  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Introduction of BEP and BAT for the environmentally sound management of Healthcare waste in Pakistan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">.The project will introduce environmentally sound management (ESM) of Health care waste (HCW) with integrated best available techniques and best environmental practices (BAT/BEP) throughout the HCW value chain (separation, collection, storage, transport, treatment, and disposal). Moreover, application of innovative technologies under a Circular Economy (CE) approach will provide a comprehensive framework to ESM of HCW. The ESM of HCW aim is to safeguard public health and protect the environment in any circumstances, especially during pandemics such as the COVID-19 pandemic</narrative>
  </description>
